Found by Anthropic OSS Scanner.

TLDR; the rte_pcapng_write_packets() assumed that mbuf nb_segs < IOV_MAX.
An mbuf with >=3D 1024 segments would overrun on stack iov[] array.

This is a low severity corner case not a security bug.

